    "detailed_description": "Enjoy the moments, take it at your own pace, delve into mysteries, listen to the sounds of the wind and spot birds and creatures on your way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intro</h2>&quot;Welcome, curious stranger, to the world of Mullar!<br><br>Come, sit by the fire - you came just in time for the gathering. I would prepare some tasty berry juice, but the berries are gone.. Because of the storms. And so, I\u2019m afraid, is half of our tribe. <br><br>Everything was so peaceful and cozy.. And suddenly, it wasn\u2019t anymore. Suddenly, it was all chaos. We don\u2019t know why or how. We just know.. That we miss our friends. I bet they\u2019re lonely out there.. Lonely and story-less. If the storms keep coming, I think we will run out of stories, too.. <br><br>But tonight, the Elder will share a tale. A dark, important one. About when The Ogi arrived - and led us into chaos. That one, it scares me. A lot.<br><br>Luckily, legends aren\u2019t true. .. They aren\u2019t, are they?&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/041da8be1a2d87e85d37952763a76775.poster.avif?t=1747641771\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/041da8be1a2d87e85d37952763a76775.webm?t=1747641771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/041da8be1a2d87e85d37952763a76775.mp4?t=1747641771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique and beautiful world, filled with mystery, history, interesting creatures and life!<br></li><li>Draw your way through puzzles, unique places and a rich emotional story!<br></li><li>Play on any device you want!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/3b8fbdf9e4c33504027bd09be6d50fec.poster.avif?t=1747641771\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/3b8fbdf9e4c33504027bd09be6d50fec.webm?t=1747641771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/3b8fbdf9e4c33504027bd09be6d50fec.mp4?t=1747641771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore and figure out mysteries through multiple ways of engaging with the world, sound and Mullar life!<br></li><li>Using a curiosity-driven exploration approach, gather knowledge through clues and mysteries to unravel the hidden legacy and culture of Mullar</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Enjoy the moments, take it at your own pace, delve into mysteries, listen to the sounds of the wind and spot birds and creatures on your way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intro</h2>&quot;Welcome, curious stranger, to the world of Mullar!<br><br>Come, sit by the fire - you came just in time for the gathering. I would prepare some tasty berry juice, but the berries are gone.. Because of the storms. And so, I\u2019m afraid, is half of our tribe. <br><br>Everything was so peaceful and cozy.. And suddenly, it wasn\u2019t anymore. Suddenly, it was all chaos. We don\u2019t know why or how. We just know.. That we miss our friends. I bet they\u2019re lonely out there.. Lonely and story-less. If the storms keep coming, I think we will run out of stories, too.. <br><br>But tonight, the Elder will share a tale. A dark, important one. About when The Ogi arrived - and led us into chaos. That one, it scares me. A lot.<br><br>Luckily, legends aren\u2019t true. .. They aren\u2019t, are they?&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/041da8be1a2d87e85d37952763a76775.poster.avif?t=1747641771\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/041da8be1a2d87e85d37952763a76775.webm?t=1747641771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/041da8be1a2d87e85d37952763a76775.mp4?t=1747641771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique and beautiful world, filled with mystery, history, interesting creatures and life!<br></li><li>Draw your way through puzzles, unique places and a rich emotional story!<br></li><li>Play on any device you want!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo